&lt;p&gt;🤖 Simon Willison shares &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/185373/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;a quick look at the last six months in LLMs.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
